# --- Local secrets -----------------------------------------------------------
# Web panel credentials for a build: `.env` holds the owner's user and password,
# and the generated header keeps only a salt and a digest of them. Both are
# per-machine, so neither is versioned; `.env.example` documents the keys.
.env
esp32_gadget/admin_seed.h

